      ],
      "body_md": "Just 'Cuz spans both conventional gearmotor/ESC drive systems and purpose-built direct weapon hardware. The Blitz Lite is a relatively heavy but mechanically serious brushless planetary drive unit, while the 2306.5 JCR Edition is a low-KV motor with a long 5mm shaft for custom drive layouts. WEKA covers high-current brushed drive; Vixen Nano/JCR-RC cover AM32 brushless drive. RDY-MINI-5022 is not just another FPV outrunner: its large bearings and direct weapon interface are specifically aimed at combat shock and weapon mounting, so it belongs in a different mechanical category than cheap drone motors."
